      "text": "Private transfer from Hotel to the airport. Fly to El Calafate.\n\nArrival in Calafate. Transfer from Airport to downtown hotel.\n\nEl Calafate is in Patagonia and is the main gateway to Los Glaciares National Park and the Perito Moreno Glacier."
